{
 "encounter_id": "00539",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Morning. Just so I've got the right file, are you Maya Kowalczyk?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's me."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll do my best. And you've brought a notebook, I see. Very organised."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I keep a diary. Since the cast came off I've written down how the wrist feels every day, otherwise I forget the details once I'm here."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Brilliant, I love a diary. Where would you like to start?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The stiffness in my wrist. I can't turn my hand over properly. The cast came off two weeks ago and it's hardly improved."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Which wrist is it, and when is it at its worst?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right wrist. Mornings, according to the diary. It eases by lunchtime."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And is there pain with it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Pain when I rotate my hand, like turning a door handle or opening a jar. A sharp twinge on the thumb side. I'd say moderate."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Jars are the classic. Does anything ease it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Warm water. I stand at the sink with my hand under the tap.",
   "pause": 3
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything else you've noticed about the hand itself?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It swells a bit by evening, the back of the wrist looks puffy. And my grip is weak. I dropped my favourite mug on Sunday."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Oh no, not the favourite. What was it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "One my sister made. I've glued it back together."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Ha, very kintsugi. Right, a few more questions. Any numbness in your fingers?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, none of that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does the wrist wake you at night?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, I sleep fine. It only bothers me when I use it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever lately?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And any redness over the wrist?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, it looks normal apart from the puffiness."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks. Now tell me about your general health. Anything long-term?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Reflux, on and off for years. And osteopenia, they found it a couple of years ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good thinking, the osteopenia matters here. Any bone problems in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mother had osteoporosis. She broke her hip at seventy."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'm sorry to hear that. Any operations in the past?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Only my appendix out, when I was fifteen."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you have any allergies, to medicines or anything else?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, none that I know of."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you do for work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm an illustrator, so it's all tablet and pen, which is why this is such a disaster."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And do you have a drink, at the end of the day?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A glass of wine on weekends, no more than that. And I've never smoked."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Are you taking anything for the pain?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ibuprofen, from the chemist. Maybe 200 milligrams? I just take the little pills, a couple a day. I'm not sure of the strength."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay, we'll come back to that. Any chest pain or palpitations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And any shortness of breath or cough?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, my breathing's fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me take your numbers while we're here."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Blood pressure is 124 over 78, pulse is 72, temperature is 36.7 degrees, and oxygen is 98 percent.",
   "pause": 10
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "You're 63 kilograms on the scales as well. Now hold both hands out, palms down."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Mild swelling over the back of the wrist on the right, yes. Now bend the wrist back as far as you can.",
   "pause": 10
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's as far as it goes. It pulls right here."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It only goes about half as far as the other side. Now close your eyes and tell me which fingertip I touch.",
   "pause": 5
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Index... middle... little finger. Ring finger. Thumb."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "All correct, so the feeling in all your fingertips is normal, which is reassuring."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So what's going on? Is the bone not mended?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "From what I see, this looks like stiffness after being in a cast, which is very common. But I can't rule out that the small bone isn't fully healed yet, so I'd like to check."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Check how?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to arrange an X-ray of the wrist, today if we can. And I'd also order a blood test for your vitamin D, given the osteopenia."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "And if the vitamin D is low?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Then I might consider a bone density scan, but we'll hold off on that for now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. And the pain? The ibuprofen hasn't been doing much."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "With your reflux I'd rather you stop the ibuprofen. I'm going to start you on paracetamol, 1 gram up to four times a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd also like to start diclofenac gel, rubbed into the wrist three times a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Perfect. Before you start on exercises, soak the hand in warm water, then do gentle wrist circles, ten of them, several times a day. Don't force it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Should I keep drawing?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "In short stretches, yes, with a break every half hour. No marathon sessions."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Now, come and see me in two weeks, once the X-ray and bloods are back, and bring the diary."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ha. I'll go and sort the X-ray, then. Thanks, doctor."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "No worries at all. Say hello to the mug for me."
  }
 ],
